<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In IV Experiments ‣ The Few-shot Dilemma: Over-prompting Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Binary Classification on Functional and Non-functional Requirements</span></span></a>
