<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLaMA-3.1</span></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">8B</span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">128k</span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.10.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">text-only</span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.10.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">15T tokens</span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.10.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">open</span></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.11" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">-8B-instruct</span></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.11.2" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.11.3" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.11.4" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.11.5" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.11.6" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.12" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLaMA-3.2</span></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">3B</span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">128k</span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.12.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">text-only</span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.12.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">distill LLaMA-3.1</span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.12.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">open</span></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.13.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">-3B-instruct</span></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.13.2" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.13.3" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.13.4" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.13.5" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.13.6" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"></span></span>
</span>
</span></p>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE I: </span>Basic information of selected LLMs.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Alongside these models, we include three BERT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">47</a>]</cite> variants as baselines – RoBERTa <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib48" title="" class="ltx_ref">48</a>]</cite>, NoRBERT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib50" title="" class="ltx_ref">50</a>]</cite>, and PRCBERT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib49" title="" class="ltx_ref">49</a>]</cite>, which hold the state-of-the-art performance on the PROMISE dataset. Since the three models do not demonstrate instruction-following abilities, they must be fine-tuned for requirement classification in a supervised fashion.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS1.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS2.4" class="ltx_text">IV-A</span>2 </span>Selected Datasets</h4>

<div id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following the trend of using LLMs to streamline the software engineering process, we study the few-shot prompting features with two datasets in this domain.
The PROMISE dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib53" title="" class="ltx_ref">53</a>]</cite>, originally annotated according to ISO-25010 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib52" title="" class="ltx_ref">52</a>]</cite>, has served as a benchmark for requirement classification for years, with extensive prior evaluations <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>, <a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">9</a>, <a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">10</a>, <a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">4</a>, <a href="#bib.bib50" title="" class="ltx_ref">50</a>, <a href="#bib.bib49" title="" class="ltx_ref">49</a>]</cite>. The PURE dataset comprises 79 raw requirement documents and 34,268 sentences <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib54" title="" class="ltx_ref">54</a>]</cite>, with 6118 sentences annotated as functional or non-functional requirements in a recent study <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib55" title="" class="ltx_ref">55</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S4.T2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:293.0pt;height:54.3pt;vertical-align:-24.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-16.3pt,3.0pt) scale(0.9,0.9) ;">
<table id="S4.T2.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T2.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
